    `posting date`            IS YMD 2026 5 15
    `payment channel`         IS `Inserted or swiped at a terminal`
    `credential`              IS `The physical card`
    `merchant indicator`      IS `Flags card-present`
    `made in Singapore`       IS TRUE

#ASSERT (`HSBC Revolution earns on` `HSBC Revolution` `a Cardholder with no Everyday Global Account deposits` `a month position this card does not read` `a card inserted at a department store`)'s `points per dollar` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`HSBC Revolution earns on` `HSBC Revolution` `a Cardholder with no Everyday Global Account deposits` `a month position this card does not read` `a card inserted at a department store`)'s `miles per dollar` EQUALS 0.4
